1
00:00:04,813 --> 00:00:05,813
Oh!

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,873
Hey, what happened?!

3
00:00:08,562 --> 00:00:09,683
What happened?!

4
00:00:09,688 --> 00:00:11,086
You’re not ready for this, Kuya Aga!

5
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,856
- What?!
- Here it is—

6
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:15,049
- breaking news! Open it!
- What?!

7
00:00:15,051 --> 00:00:16,106
Bam!

8
00:00:16,617 --> 00:00:20,154
Auditions are open for
Sagala Queen 2025!!

9
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:25,092
I thought there was some major
crime the way you were reacting!

10
00:00:25,093 --> 00:00:27,794
Nice, Kuya Je!
We can hang out at the auditions!

11
00:00:30,627 --> 00:00:32,505
I’ll tell Anne on you!

12
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:34,604
Oh no!

13
00:00:35,736 --> 00:00:37,424
Actually, I kinda wanna audition!

14
00:00:37,432 --> 00:00:39,006
- Huh?
- You?!

15
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,240
You serious, Tash?

16
00:00:40,244 --> 00:00:43,744
I think I wanna be part
of the barangay tradition.

17
00:00:43,752 --> 00:00:46,248
Hmm, that could work!
What’s the catch?

18
00:00:46,257 --> 00:00:50,873
Picture this—
great promo for Bake Haus of U!

19
00:00:50,898 --> 00:00:53,970
The prettiest girl
in Barangay Singko

20
00:00:53,994 --> 00:00:58,045
managing the most
beautiful bakery in town!

21
00:00:58,053 --> 00:01:00,255
That’s brilliant!

22
00:01:00,272 --> 00:01:01,352
Eyyy!

23
00:01:01,358 --> 00:01:03,230
Love the game, love the grind!

24
00:01:08,351 --> 00:01:09,351
Wait, hold up!

25
00:01:09,366 --> 00:01:12,305
You know what, Atasha?
I’m all for this!

26
00:01:12,329 --> 00:01:15,830
You know, back in the day—
Lola Maxie, kids, my love—

27
00:01:15,835 --> 00:01:18,011
I used to be a Reyna Elena!

28
00:01:18,015 --> 00:01:19,115
Oh yeah!

29
00:01:19,905 --> 00:01:22,731
Hey, hey, hey!
Cha, you weren’t the only one!

30
00:01:23,554 --> 00:01:24,623
I was Reyna Elena too!

31
00:01:24,624 --> 00:01:27,553
It runs in the family, sweetie.

32
00:01:27,561 --> 00:01:33,866
Being Reyna Elena is in our blood!

33
00:01:33,878 --> 00:01:35,438
Really, Lola Maxie?

34
00:01:35,441 --> 00:01:37,332
You look so surprised!

35
00:01:38,871 --> 00:01:40,843
No, really.

36
00:01:40,853 --> 00:01:48,291
I remember men lining up
just to see my flower!

37
00:01:48,298 --> 00:01:49,298
Huh?!

38
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,300
Yes!

39
00:01:50,301 --> 00:01:54,098
Even if my flowers
were already wilted…

40
00:01:54,105 --> 00:01:56,840
Sounds like you just
admitted something!

41
00:01:56,855 --> 00:02:00,135
Come on! We’re eating here!

42
00:02:00,139 --> 00:02:04,658
- There she goes again!
- Lola Maxie, seriously?!

43
00:02:04,663 --> 00:02:06,131
Enough already!

44
00:02:06,131 --> 00:02:08,912
Look what you made me do—
I lost my train of thought!

45
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,964
And don’t be so dirty-minded!

46
00:02:10,975 --> 00:02:12,927
What I meant was…

47
00:02:12,936 --> 00:02:14,435
What was wilted?

48
00:02:16,703 --> 00:02:20,450
…the flower on the arch!

49
00:02:20,474 --> 00:02:21,723
Ah!

50
00:02:24,565 --> 00:02:27,181
Guys would line up…

51
00:02:27,182 --> 00:02:28,603
For the wilted flower?

52
00:02:28,611 --> 00:02:30,617
…to take a picture with me!

53
00:02:30,619 --> 00:02:31,852
Ah!

54
00:02:38,149 --> 00:02:40,127
See? You misunderstood!

55
00:02:41,789 --> 00:02:43,917
You want proof?

56
00:02:45,016 --> 00:02:46,766
- Go up to the fourth floor!
- Huh? Fourth?

57
00:02:46,774 --> 00:02:50,003
There’s a box by the door—get it.

58
00:02:50,027 --> 00:02:51,039
Okay!

59
00:02:51,064 --> 00:02:57,444
See?! Sometimes she can’t even handle
what’s going on anymore! Hey!

60
00:02:57,445 --> 00:02:59,145
- Here it is!
- That was fast!

61
00:02:59,146 --> 00:03:00,206
It’s on the fourth floor!

62
00:03:00,208 --> 00:03:03,626
There’s a secret passage,
and only I know it.

63
00:03:03,638 --> 00:03:05,152
Secret!

64
00:03:05,153 --> 00:03:06,387
Wait, wait.

65
00:03:06,396 --> 00:03:11,116
Tash, I think you can wear this—

66
00:03:11,124 --> 00:03:13,527
we’re the same size!

67
00:03:13,530 --> 00:03:14,530
Or we used to be.

68
00:03:14,538 --> 00:03:16,764
Here, it’ll fit you!

69
00:03:16,764 --> 00:03:19,658
Oh, it’s so pretty!
Love the color!

70
00:03:19,663 --> 00:03:21,279
- Wow!
- Navy blue!

71
00:03:21,288 --> 00:03:25,305
- We just need to wash it a bit.
- Hey! Lola Maxie!

72
00:03:25,309 --> 00:03:26,569
Lola Maxi!

73
00:03:26,575 --> 00:03:27,741
Isn’t it beautiful?!

74
00:03:29,614 --> 00:03:32,399
Lola Maxie, we’re literally
eating right now!

75
00:03:32,402 --> 00:03:34,394
I’ll have my granddaughter try it on!

76
00:03:34,395 --> 00:03:36,497
But there’s food!
Look at all the dust!

77
00:04:37,284 --> 00:04:39,071
Tso K, I’m doing this!

78
00:04:40,721 --> 00:04:41,721
Really?!

79
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:45,085
I didn’t know
this was your dream too—

80
00:04:45,108 --> 00:04:46,986
to join the sagala!

81
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:50,056
Tso K, it’s not my dream.

82
00:04:50,616 --> 00:04:55,125
My dream is for our bakery
to be number one!

83
00:04:55,133 --> 00:04:56,830
Think about it, Tso K—

84
00:04:56,837 --> 00:04:58,580
If I become Reyna Elena,

85
00:04:58,604 --> 00:04:59,684
it’s instant marketing!

86
00:04:59,696 --> 00:05:02,002
We’ll get tons of exposure!
Right?!

87
00:05:03,395 --> 00:05:04,775
Bake K Nemen—

88
00:05:05,582 --> 00:05:10,492
the store with the fairest price,

89
00:05:10,497 --> 00:05:15,449
managed by the fairest girl of them all!

90
00:05:18,397 --> 00:05:20,207
That’s great!

91
00:05:20,215 --> 00:05:23,608
And from now on, I’m all in.
I support you!

92
00:05:23,616 --> 00:05:26,305
I’ll even be your trainer!

93
00:05:26,329 --> 00:05:30,130
In case you didn’t know,
I’ve joined the sagala before!

94
00:05:31,345 --> 00:05:33,500
- Really?!
- Yes!

95
00:05:34,633 --> 00:05:39,554
I love it! Parades! So fun.

96
00:05:39,579 --> 00:05:40,579
Tso K!

97
00:05:43,701 --> 00:05:53,553
Tso K, if this is your way of
telling me something, it’s okay.

98
00:05:54,592 --> 00:05:59,726
Because no matter what,
I accept you.

99
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:01,995
I won’t ever reject you.

100
00:06:02,395 --> 00:06:06,332
I love you so much—
you’re my favorite uncle!

101
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:13,192
i’ll even be proud…
even if you’re gay!

102
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,200
Hey!

103
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,463
What do you mean gay?!

104
00:06:15,473 --> 00:06:17,012
Who told you I’m gay?!

105
00:06:17,012 --> 00:06:20,513
I’m not gay!

106
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,687
You want me to kick you?!

107
00:06:21,692 --> 00:06:23,073
In the lungs?! Huh?!

108
00:06:23,822 --> 00:06:24,881
Don’t say that—I’m not gay!

109
00:06:24,886 --> 00:06:29,753
I told you, I joined the sagala
as Prince Constantine!

110
00:06:29,761 --> 00:06:32,793
I wasn’t one of those queens! No way!

111
00:06:34,022 --> 00:06:35,528
My goodness!

112
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:37,864
Sorry, Tso K, I just thought…

113
00:06:37,866 --> 00:06:41,801
So how does Prince
Constantine walk?

114
00:06:41,804 --> 00:06:46,249
It’s simple! Just straight!

115
00:06:46,256 --> 00:06:48,618
Just walk straight like this!

116
00:06:48,631 --> 00:06:53,458
The queens, they’re the ones
who do all the moves!

117
00:06:53,482 --> 00:06:55,625
Like that! Like that!

118
00:06:55,629 --> 00:06:58,324
They do that flouncy walk like that!

119
00:06:58,332 --> 00:07:00,486
They walk like that!

120
00:07:00,496 --> 00:07:01,496
You want that?

121
00:07:01,503 --> 00:07:03,537
I’m kinda getting into this!

122
00:07:04,737 --> 00:07:07,269
- It’s cute—but you’re not gay!
- Nope! Man right here!

123
00:07:07,278 --> 00:07:08,278
But wait!

124
00:07:08,286 --> 00:07:11,051
There is still a bit of
a sway in the walk!

125
00:07:11,068 --> 00:07:12,499
- But you’re not gay?!
- I said no!

126
00:07:12,513 --> 00:07:16,636
Okay, Barangay Singko, listen up!

127
00:07:16,645 --> 00:07:24,294
I promise you—I, Maita Macapinlak—
will give you the best sagala ever!

128
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:26,996
Show them the poster, girl! Quick!

129
00:07:27,004 --> 00:07:28,881
There! Read it!

130
00:07:28,885 --> 00:07:30,750
Boss Beauty, who’s she?

131
00:07:30,762 --> 00:07:32,051
Didn’t you hear?!

132
00:07:32,059 --> 00:07:33,472
That’s Miss Maita!

133
00:07:33,489 --> 00:07:36,757
She’s the organizer of the sagala!

134
00:07:39,558 --> 00:07:43,566
So go read that!
I’m looking for participants!

135
00:07:43,581 --> 00:07:48,501
Miss Maita, what exactly
are you looking for in a queen?

136
00:07:48,503 --> 00:07:53,288
Well, we’re looking for real women!

137
00:07:53,291 --> 00:07:57,877
Miss Maita, how about
short hair in the back?

138
00:08:00,811 --> 00:08:03,185
Maybe I qualify?

139
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:08,049
Again, just to be clear—
we’re looking for actual women.

140
00:08:08,053 --> 00:08:09,523
Okay, forget it. I’m out.

141
00:08:10,587 --> 00:08:12,059
Wait!

142
00:08:12,084 --> 00:08:13,084
Oh my gosh!

143
00:08:13,099 --> 00:08:16,708
I just spotted someone!

144
00:08:22,437 --> 00:08:24,539
Assuming much?!
That’s me! That’s me!

145
00:08:24,553 --> 00:08:25,698
You two—step aside!

146
00:08:25,702 --> 00:08:28,340
Oh my gosh! You’re perfect!

147
00:08:28,365 --> 00:08:30,027
Come here!

148
00:08:30,038 --> 00:08:31,287
You!

149
00:08:31,296 --> 00:08:33,530
You’re the most perfect one!

150
00:08:33,538 --> 00:08:37,083
Will you be our Prince Constantine?

151
00:08:37,085 --> 00:08:38,155
M-me?!

152
00:08:38,163 --> 00:08:39,436
- Yes!
- Uh, sure.

153
00:08:39,436 --> 00:08:41,654
Stand up straight!
Open your mouth!

154
00:08:43,589 --> 00:08:44,715
Jump!

155
00:08:44,723 --> 00:08:45,992
Spin!

156
00:08:46,536 --> 00:08:49,362
Smile! Smile! Smile!
Blow a kiss!

157
00:08:50,439 --> 00:08:51,598
Perfect!

158
00:08:52,853 --> 00:08:57,539
Atasha, you have to walk like
this if you want to be Reyna Elena!

159
00:08:57,544 --> 00:09:01,643
Think royalty—
chin up, then wave!

160
00:09:01,667 --> 00:09:07,315
Wave! Wave! Look! Look! See?

161
00:09:07,339 --> 00:09:11,094
That looks kinda arrogant though!

162
00:09:11,112 --> 00:09:12,549
Oh really?

163
00:09:12,557 --> 00:09:15,722
Sweetheart, you have to look like
a true Reyna Elena.

164
00:09:15,729 --> 00:09:18,624
Be a little more dainty—
hands folded.

165
00:09:18,644 --> 00:09:22,228
Huh?! Like this, Lola Maxie?!

166
00:09:22,229 --> 00:09:24,437
- As a sweet girl!
- Exactly!

167
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:28,994
Sweet… I think it needs confidence too,
like a little hip action…like this!

168
00:09:29,011 --> 00:09:31,238
That! That!

169
00:09:31,241 --> 00:09:34,841
- That looks indecent!
- No, it doesn’t!

170
00:09:34,845 --> 00:09:37,970
Why does it look… Honestly,
it’s supposed to be like that!

171
00:09:37,986 --> 00:09:40,673
- Okay, hold on!
- Demure, Lola Maxie?!

172
00:09:40,681 --> 00:09:42,038
Exactly!

173
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:44,824
Hold up—I think I can do this!

174
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,386
You sure?

175
00:09:46,387 --> 00:09:49,071
- We gave some pretty good tips, right?
- No…

176
00:09:49,096 --> 00:09:51,691
Then why ask if
you won’t listen?!

177
00:09:51,699 --> 00:09:54,330
I got this.
You all go home. Just rest!

178
00:09:54,341 --> 00:09:59,357
Yeah, let’s go. Lola Maxie,
don’t forget our gig!

179
00:09:59,381 --> 00:10:03,470
…Sway, then hand up…

180
00:10:04,224 --> 00:10:08,474
Ahem, ahem, ahem—Hey!

181
00:10:09,885 --> 00:10:11,299
You again?!

182
00:10:12,182 --> 00:10:14,127
You sure about this?

183
00:10:14,127 --> 00:10:18,580
Because I’m also auditioning
to be Reyna Elena.

184
00:10:18,588 --> 00:10:21,588
Oh really?! That fits you!

185
00:10:21,596 --> 00:10:24,691
Villains love the spotlight!

186
00:10:27,845 --> 00:10:33,133
And people with ugly
attitudes can’t be queens!

187
00:10:34,704 --> 00:10:35,935
Actually, you know what?

188
00:10:35,938 --> 00:10:42,685
Reyna Elena suits you—
you’re the queen of greed!

189
00:10:42,696 --> 00:10:43,696
Greedy!

190
00:10:43,704 --> 00:10:45,086
- Greedy.
- There!

191
00:10:45,103 --> 00:10:47,985
Like that!

192
00:10:47,985 --> 00:10:50,595
You know, you could
totally be a queen.

193
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:53,532
Queen of the overdramatic!

194
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:54,954
Oh really?

195
00:10:54,962 --> 00:11:00,693
- Mm-hmm!
- Well… may the best queen win!

196
00:11:07,523 --> 00:11:08,554
Excuse me!

197
00:11:09,369 --> 00:11:10,482
You’re crossing the line!

198
00:11:10,507 --> 00:11:12,445
Oh look, a parting shot?!
Excuse me!

199
00:11:12,460 --> 00:11:14,473
- Are you guys supposed to be here?
- Uh, no…

200
00:11:14,476 --> 00:11:16,888
We’re with the Da Pers family.

201
00:11:17,419 --> 00:11:18,716
We’re here to audition!

202
00:11:19,646 --> 00:11:22,472
- We just auditioned!
- Ah…audit–?

203
00:11:22,482 --> 00:11:23,515
Right?!

204
00:11:24,177 --> 00:11:25,804
We did all those moves and stuff?!

205
00:11:27,888 --> 00:11:30,368
They said it needs to be funny.

206
00:11:30,385 --> 00:11:32,625
- Huh?! Funny?
- Funny?!

207
00:11:32,627 --> 00:11:33,627
- Funny.
- It has to be funny?!

208
00:11:33,635 --> 00:11:34,794
Funny?

209
00:11:34,799 --> 00:11:36,587
- It has to be funny.
- So we have to be funny?!

210
00:11:36,596 --> 00:11:38,158
- Entertaining.
- Funny.

211
00:11:38,166 --> 00:11:39,767
- Funny.
- Funny.

212
00:11:39,775 --> 00:11:41,735
-Turns out it has to be funny.
- Oh!

213
00:11:44,404 --> 00:11:45,678
- It has to be funny?
- Funny!

214
00:11:45,682 --> 00:11:46,845
- Funny.
- How funny?

215
00:11:46,854 --> 00:11:48,770
It has to be funny?
It has to? Has to?

216
00:11:48,795 --> 00:11:52,138
Hey! That’s personal now!

217
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,662
Okay sure, you go pull the
hair of the other one too—

218
00:11:55,672 --> 00:11:57,138
she’s around the corner.

219
00:11:57,156 --> 00:11:58,394
They’re hilarious!

220
00:11:58,399 --> 00:12:01,187
- May the best queen win!
- May the best queen win!

221
00:12:07,628 --> 00:12:09,029
Hannah, wrong house!
Wrong house!

222
00:12:22,774 --> 00:12:24,079
Hey, Tash!

223
00:12:24,087 --> 00:12:26,546
Won’t that upset
the people eating it?

224
00:12:26,548 --> 00:12:28,428
Because seriously, Kuya Chard!

225
00:12:28,431 --> 00:12:32,524
This Hannah is always
getting in the way of my plans!

226
00:12:32,532 --> 00:12:34,921
Don’t focus on Hannah!

227
00:12:34,931 --> 00:12:37,066
Focus on your audition!

228
00:12:37,079 --> 00:12:39,258
That’s what you
should be thinking about!

229
00:12:39,267 --> 00:12:43,430
How can I focus if Hannah
keeps distracting me?!

230
00:12:43,443 --> 00:12:45,106
- How?!
- You know what,

231
00:12:45,130 --> 00:12:47,934
you should give Hannah a
taste of her own medicine.

232
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:50,973
No one’s challenged her yet,
that’s why!

233
00:12:50,982 --> 00:12:53,944
So how do we distract her?

234
00:12:53,945 --> 00:12:56,042
What’s the perfect bait?

235
00:12:58,015 --> 00:12:59,015
A guy?

236
00:12:59,992 --> 00:13:01,531
Hmm, could work.

237
00:13:01,562 --> 00:13:03,316
A guy? You’re setting her up with a guy?

238
00:13:04,564 --> 00:13:05,564
- That might work!
- Totally!

239
00:13:05,572 --> 00:13:09,095
Sounds like that’s my role
then if we’re talking about guys!

240
00:13:09,104 --> 00:13:10,223
Leave it to me

241
00:13:10,229 --> 00:13:16,583
! I’ll mess with her head—
she won’t know what hit her!

242
00:13:16,592 --> 00:13:18,679
One wink and she’s done for!

243
00:13:18,693 --> 00:13:21,802
Let’s be realistic here, Je,
it’s you we’re talking about!

244
00:13:21,818 --> 00:13:24,179
- Huh?! Me?!
- Yes!

245
00:13:24,203 --> 00:13:26,615
Come on, don’t do me like that!

246
00:13:26,619 --> 00:13:27,950
She’s got a nasty attitude!

247
00:13:27,955 --> 00:13:30,884
- Still, you’ve got game, bro!
- Huh?! Wasn’t this your idea?

248
00:13:30,908 --> 00:13:32,142
What?

249
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:33,150
This was your plan!

250
00:13:33,158 --> 00:13:34,646
- Oh right! Yeah, yeah!
- Your idea.

251
00:13:34,650 --> 00:13:38,600
Didn’t you say you were the most
macho guy in Barangay Singko?

252
00:13:38,614 --> 00:13:40,098
Did I say that?

253
00:13:40,114 --> 00:13:41,287
You did!

254
00:13:41,291 --> 00:13:43,283
So it’s not true?

255
00:13:43,284 --> 00:13:45,458
Oh! Prove it then!

256
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:48,020
You’re saying it’s not true?

257
00:13:48,038 --> 00:13:50,029
Are you challenging me?!

258
00:13:50,038 --> 00:13:54,092
Fine, I’ll distract Hannah myself!

259
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:56,702
I’ll win her over with my charm!

260
00:13:57,540 --> 00:14:00,006
She’ll say yes in no time!

261
00:14:00,017 --> 00:14:02,011
- Whoa! Go big!
- Yeah!

262
00:14:02,017 --> 00:14:05,578
- Excuse me, okay.
- Wow!

263
00:14:06,512 --> 00:14:07,918
- Wow, thank you!
- Here you go, Madam Maita!

264
00:14:07,923 --> 00:14:11,189
Wow, you’re so hospitable here!

265
00:14:12,635 --> 00:14:14,008
Of course, Maita!

266
00:14:14,025 --> 00:14:18,608
We know you’re the hermana mayor
of Flores de Mayo!

267
00:14:18,633 --> 00:14:23,447
I’m sure you’re tired,
so we want to give you only the best!

268
00:14:23,471 --> 00:14:24,697
Thanks!

269
00:14:26,155 --> 00:14:27,678
Let me try this—
wow, you really went all out—

270
00:14:27,695 --> 00:14:28,695
Hello, Maita!

271
00:14:31,211 --> 00:14:33,144
I also want the best for you!

272
00:14:34,086 --> 00:14:36,292
- Oh!
- This is from me—

273
00:14:36,297 --> 00:14:38,320
and my niece, Hannah!

274
00:14:38,336 --> 00:14:41,883
Wow, that’s a lot!
You’re too generous!

275
00:14:41,890 --> 00:14:42,890
BFF!

276
00:14:44,015 --> 00:14:46,285
Are you… bribing Madam Maita?!

277
00:14:46,806 --> 00:14:47,925
No!

278
00:14:47,930 --> 00:14:50,391
I’m just doing the
same thing you all are!

279
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:52,372
Wait—so we’re calling it
bribery now?

280
00:14:52,375 --> 00:14:55,070
Guys, guys, guys—hold on!

281
00:14:55,079 --> 00:14:56,445
Don’t worry!

282
00:14:56,454 --> 00:15:01,029
I know your candidates are amazing!

283
00:15:01,045 --> 00:15:05,058
I know that!
And I will judge fairly, I promise!

284
00:15:05,061 --> 00:15:06,672
Thanks, Maita!

285
00:15:06,686 --> 00:15:10,736
Except…
for the Prince of the Sagala!

286
00:15:10,738 --> 00:15:15,511
Because I’ve got
my eye on someone!

287
00:15:15,528 --> 00:15:16,883
Handsome!

288
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:19,919
Cute smile!

289
00:15:20,873 --> 00:15:22,788
Fair-skinned!

290
00:15:22,790 --> 00:15:24,370
Thank you, thank you!

291
00:15:24,381 --> 00:15:27,660
Such a great body!

292
00:15:27,670 --> 00:15:28,670
Hold on.

293
00:15:28,671 --> 00:15:30,225
He’s perfect!

294
00:15:31,053 --> 00:15:32,198
Madam…

295
00:15:32,205 --> 00:15:34,611
cute, perfect,

296
00:15:34,636 --> 00:15:37,970
nice smile, mestizo, fit body…

297
00:15:40,488 --> 00:15:44,176
My only problem is
I don’t know where to get a barong.

298
00:15:48,137 --> 00:15:49,281
- That’s him!
- Huh?

299
00:15:49,286 --> 00:15:50,650
That’s him!

300
00:15:50,661 --> 00:15:51,951
Perfect!

301
00:15:51,958 --> 00:15:56,053
Just look—so perfect as the Prince!

302
00:15:56,077 --> 00:15:59,759
Hey! Save him, quick!
Save our baby boy!

303
00:15:59,769 --> 00:16:02,831
- What do you mean baby boy?!
- Look, he’s hugging her!

304
00:16:02,839 --> 00:16:04,564
My love… Just let him be!

305
00:16:04,565 --> 00:16:06,608
Let him learn life the hard way!

306
00:16:06,612 --> 00:16:07,737
He can handle it!

307
00:16:07,737 --> 00:16:11,313
Wow, it’s really him!

308
00:16:11,321 --> 00:16:16,175
Handsome, cute smile,
great body, fair skin!

309
00:16:17,643 --> 00:16:19,286
- So, BFF?
- What?

310
00:16:19,294 --> 00:16:20,674
Feels like we lost
track of the convo.

311
00:16:20,677 --> 00:16:21,677
That’s it?

312
00:16:22,912 --> 00:16:23,932
You sure?

313
00:16:26,084 --> 00:16:30,379
You two owe a lot!
Always borrowing!

314
00:16:30,383 --> 00:16:31,576
I’m taking everything now.

315
00:16:34,218 --> 00:16:36,462
But come back, okay?

316
00:16:36,469 --> 00:16:38,504
- You remember the plan, right?
- Thank you!

317
00:16:38,504 --> 00:16:41,176
Okay, here’s how it goes!

318
00:16:41,184 --> 00:16:43,478
Pretend to rob her,

319
00:16:43,489 --> 00:16:46,168
then she’ll panic!

320
00:16:46,169 --> 00:16:47,546
She’ll call for help!

321
00:16:47,551 --> 00:16:50,702
Then I swoop in, save her,
and she falls for me!

322
00:16:50,718 --> 00:16:52,748
Leave it to me, Je!
You’re brilliant!

323
00:16:52,765 --> 00:16:54,061
Solid!

324
00:16:54,061 --> 00:16:55,061
Here we go!

325
00:16:56,968 --> 00:16:59,018
Great sales today!

326
00:16:59,022 --> 00:17:00,223
I’m going in!

327
00:17:05,145 --> 00:17:07,293
This is a stick-up! Don’t move!

328
00:17:07,301 --> 00:17:11,129
I’ve got a lot of victims—
maybe you’re next.

329
00:17:11,137 --> 00:17:12,244
- A stick-up?!
- Yeah.

330
00:17:13,209 --> 00:17:15,822
- Do you even have to ask—
- Help! Help! Help!

331
00:17:15,824 --> 00:17:20,351
Hannah, Hannah, don’t worry!

332
00:17:20,351 --> 00:17:23,242
I’m here to save you—
with my fists!

333
00:17:28,984 --> 00:17:30,405
Oh!

334
00:17:30,406 --> 00:17:32,518
A hold-up, huh?!

335
00:17:33,149 --> 00:17:35,221
So you’re the robbers!

336
00:17:38,391 --> 00:17:39,774
You’re so extra!

337
00:17:40,571 --> 00:17:41,994
Hey, hey, hey!

338
00:17:42,008 --> 00:17:44,430
- Please have mercy!
- Come here!

339
00:17:44,436 --> 00:17:47,670
Hannah, Hannah, don’t hurt him!
He’s not a robber—

340
00:17:47,678 --> 00:17:49,139
it’s just Chard!
It’s just Chard!

341
00:17:51,264 --> 00:17:52,777
I knew it was Chard!

342
00:17:54,201 --> 00:17:56,021
I told you, and you still tried to rob me!

343
00:17:58,110 --> 00:18:01,397
Wow, our friend’s got charm—
even the older women are into him!

344
00:18:01,422 --> 00:18:03,782
Hey, shh! Keep your voice down,
someone might hear you!

345
00:18:04,743 --> 00:18:08,613
Andres, just tell her
you have a girlfriend!

346
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:11,774
Right? Right?!

347
00:18:11,782 --> 00:18:15,094
Don’t contradict it!

348
00:18:15,101 --> 00:18:17,884
And plus, if you fight her,

349
00:18:17,890 --> 00:18:19,332
she might not consider

350
00:18:19,343 --> 00:18:21,003
- Tash as Reyna Elena!
- You think?!

351
00:18:21,007 --> 00:18:22,741
- Yeah, that’s true.
- Yeah, fair enough. Sorry, sorry!

352
00:18:22,749 --> 00:18:25,667
Our friend hasn’t said a word.
Maybe his tongue was cut off?

353
00:18:25,671 --> 00:18:27,732
But he agrees, right? You agree?

354
00:18:27,735 --> 00:18:28,843
See? They agree!

355
00:18:28,844 --> 00:18:30,781
- You too? You agree?
- Yes, I agree!

356
00:18:30,789 --> 00:18:31,789
Okay, okay!

357
00:18:31,797 --> 00:18:35,594
- Hi! Hi, Andres!
- Hi there!

358
00:18:35,602 --> 00:18:37,925
- Hi!
- Hi, what are you doing here?

359
00:18:37,938 --> 00:18:41,577
Nothing really—I just passed by
since I knew you work here.

360
00:18:41,586 --> 00:18:43,456
- Oh.
- Don’t worry, Andres—

361
00:18:43,461 --> 00:18:44,789
we’ve got your back.

362
00:18:44,789 --> 00:18:46,062
We’ve got his back
or only you do?

363
00:18:46,071 --> 00:18:47,156
We do!

364
00:18:47,161 --> 00:18:48,516
Oh, by the way,

365
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:50,598
I brought food for you—
and your friends!

366
00:18:51,403 --> 00:18:53,096
Thanks! Pizza!

367
00:18:58,587 --> 00:19:00,007
Protect, protect!

368
00:19:02,005 --> 00:19:04,492
I was actually hoping
to get a massage.

369
00:19:04,493 --> 00:19:07,846
My muscles really hurt.

370
00:19:07,853 --> 00:19:11,342
Actually, I’m just the
social media manager.

371
00:19:11,351 --> 00:19:13,068
I don’t do massages.

372
00:19:13,069 --> 00:19:15,077
Oh really? That’s a shame.

373
00:19:15,085 --> 00:19:17,499
I was gonna give you a big tip.

374
00:19:17,507 --> 00:19:20,026
I really can’t, ma’am. Sorry.

375
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:22,171
Alright, I’ll try somewhere else.

376
00:19:23,307 --> 00:19:24,764
- I'll go.
- Wait, wait, wait!

377
00:19:24,773 --> 00:19:27,475
Madam! Madam Maita!
How are you?

378
00:19:27,483 --> 00:19:28,910
Andres, what happened?

379
00:19:28,913 --> 00:19:30,158
Tso K! Umm…

380
00:19:30,166 --> 00:19:33,408
Are you turning down Madam Maita?

381
00:19:33,416 --> 00:19:36,119
- No, it’s not that—
- She’s a VIP!

382
00:19:36,119 --> 00:19:38,110
Not just any VIP—
she’s a customer!

383
00:19:38,768 --> 00:19:40,336
And the hermana mayor!

384
00:19:40,344 --> 00:19:42,555
- Oh, yes!
- You can’t say no to her!

385
00:19:42,563 --> 00:19:43,563
That would be rude!

386
00:19:43,571 --> 00:19:45,516
Give her the massage!

387
00:19:45,524 --> 00:19:46,793
Okay, uhm…

388
00:19:46,805 --> 00:19:48,258
Madam Maita, let’s head inside.

389
00:19:48,274 --> 00:19:50,356
There! A customer’s a customer!

390
00:19:50,364 --> 00:19:53,442
Thanks! Alright.

391
00:19:53,450 --> 00:19:58,697
Wow, how lucky can one person get?!

392
00:20:04,415 --> 00:20:05,415
Hi, Hannah!

393
00:20:06,515 --> 00:20:07,904
Hey, Je!

394
00:20:07,913 --> 00:20:10,261
Get out of here,
I’m not in the mood!

395
00:20:10,285 --> 00:20:17,449
I just came to say sorry
for that prank with Chard.

396
00:20:18,508 --> 00:20:20,781
You’re such a pretty girl,
why the frown?

397
00:20:24,004 --> 00:20:25,101
Because!

398
00:20:25,794 --> 00:20:28,652
I’ve been trying
on dresses all day,

399
00:20:28,653 --> 00:20:31,208
and couldn’t find a
good one for the sagala!

400
00:20:31,216 --> 00:20:34,900
The only one I liked doesn’t even fit!

401
00:20:34,911 --> 00:20:40,372
Why were you trying them
on outside the store anyway?

402
00:20:40,382 --> 00:20:42,678
- You could’ve used the inside!
- It’s got more space!

403
00:20:42,687 --> 00:20:44,310
Actually,

404
00:20:44,327 --> 00:20:46,170
I noticed—

405
00:20:46,171 --> 00:20:49,381
anything you wear
looks good on you.

406
00:20:49,405 --> 00:20:50,616
You’re that pretty.

407
00:20:53,927 --> 00:20:55,134
Pfft!

408
00:20:55,135 --> 00:20:57,566
Oh! By the way!

409
00:20:57,590 --> 00:20:58,591
What?

410
00:20:58,608 --> 00:21:00,069
I thought of something.

411
00:21:00,077 --> 00:21:03,162
Boss Beauty, and Mariposa

412
00:21:03,171 --> 00:21:07,300
might have dresses
for rent you’d like!

413
00:21:07,307 --> 00:21:08,307
Try checking them out.

414
00:21:08,308 --> 00:21:09,716
- Oh?
- Yeah!

415
00:21:10,502 --> 00:21:11,908
Wait—

416
00:21:11,916 --> 00:21:13,666
why are you helping me?

417
00:21:13,666 --> 00:21:16,742
Uh, no reason!

418
00:21:18,174 --> 00:21:23,053
That’s just how we are
in Barangay Singko.

419
00:21:24,199 --> 00:21:25,199
Kind,

420
00:21:26,794 --> 00:21:32,792
helpful, and full of love.

421
00:21:35,534 --> 00:21:36,534
Ah, okay!

422
00:21:38,813 --> 00:21:39,813
Fine.

423
00:21:41,307 --> 00:21:42,487
Help me then.

424
00:21:42,487 --> 00:21:45,804
Help me with this—
just zip it up properly.

425
00:21:47,276 --> 00:21:48,383
Just lift this part?

426
00:21:48,386 --> 00:21:49,698
- Yeah, lift it—lift it.
- Oh!

427
00:21:50,737 --> 00:21:51,874
- Huh?
- Oh!

428
00:21:51,878 --> 00:21:52,878
What?!

429
00:21:52,879 --> 00:21:54,780
- You’re unbelievable!
- Why?

430
00:21:54,791 --> 00:21:57,346
Do you want to take
advantage of me?!

431
00:21:57,354 --> 00:21:59,185
We’re not even together!

432
00:21:59,190 --> 00:22:02,255
Isn’t this enough?!

433
00:22:04,277 --> 00:22:08,484
What? Hold up—I’m going home!

434
00:22:08,488 --> 00:22:09,888
- Why?!
- I need to pee.

435
00:22:09,894 --> 00:22:10,894
What?!

436
00:22:11,784 --> 00:22:12,784
Hey!

437
00:22:15,625 --> 00:22:17,189
Uh, ma’am?

438
00:22:17,204 --> 00:22:19,146
- Yes?
- Are you ready?

439
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:21,474
Oh yes, I’m so ready for you!

440
00:22:21,488 --> 00:22:22,742
Uh, okay.

441
00:22:27,079 --> 00:22:30,310
- Um, is the pressure okay?
- Oh yes!

442
00:22:30,313 --> 00:22:32,915
Actually, that’s not pressure
anymore—

443
00:22:32,922 --> 00:22:34,963
it’s pleasure!

444
00:22:34,969 --> 00:22:36,156
Ugh, Tash!

445
00:22:36,180 --> 00:22:39,103
I wouldn’t even be doing
this if it weren’t for you!

446
00:22:39,109 --> 00:22:41,907
More! More and more,
Andres! More!

447
00:22:41,914 --> 00:22:43,462
Okay.

448
00:22:43,469 --> 00:22:45,398
Come on, press harder!

449
00:22:45,408 --> 00:22:47,324
- More!
- Okay.

450
00:22:47,328 --> 00:22:48,539
There!

451
00:22:51,868 --> 00:22:53,605
More, more, more!

452
00:22:53,610 --> 00:22:55,107
Ma’am, I really can’t—

453
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:56,422
I have a girlfriend.

454
00:22:56,438 --> 00:22:58,143
Yeah, and so?

455
00:22:58,157 --> 00:22:59,157
Huh?

456
00:23:00,212 --> 00:23:02,138
I don’t want to cheat
on my girlfriend!

457
00:23:03,197 --> 00:23:04,197
Hey!

458
00:23:04,203 --> 00:23:05,418
What are you saying?

459
00:23:05,421 --> 00:23:07,252
I don’t even like you that way, kid!

460
00:23:07,257 --> 00:23:10,088
I just think you’re cute,

461
00:23:10,093 --> 00:23:11,757
and I really need a massage—

462
00:23:11,757 --> 00:23:15,288
being the hermana mayor
is so stressful!

463
00:23:15,304 --> 00:23:16,727
Ah, okay, okay!

464
00:23:16,751 --> 00:23:18,497
- There, that’s better!
- Sorry, ma’am! Sorry.

465
00:23:18,513 --> 00:23:20,437
I was just overthinking it. My bad.

466
00:23:20,445 --> 00:23:24,525
Mmm, but if you do like me,
I might consider…

467
00:23:24,531 --> 00:23:27,349
Ow! Ow, ow! That hurts!

468
00:23:27,357 --> 00:23:28,607
There, that’s the spot—

469
00:23:28,615 --> 00:23:29,841
it really hurts there!

470
00:23:29,849 --> 00:23:31,553
- Ah, here?
- Yes, yes, yes, yes.

471
00:23:31,577 --> 00:23:33,679
- Okay.
- Push a little harder—there!

472
00:23:38,151 --> 00:23:39,268
Okay, thank you!

473
00:23:40,963 --> 00:23:42,054
Next!

474
00:23:43,971 --> 00:23:45,390
Okay, go ahead, sit down.

475
00:23:53,210 --> 00:23:54,834
Hear ye, hear ye!

476
00:23:54,848 --> 00:24:00,674
The most beautiful girl
in town is here!

477
00:24:00,684 --> 00:24:02,061
The one and only Tash
from Barangay Singko!

478
00:24:04,075 --> 00:24:07,473
Hello, Miss Hermana Maita!

479
00:24:07,489 --> 00:24:14,153
I’m Atasha, a 20-something stunner, gunner,
and heart-runner from Barangay Singko!

480
00:24:15,296 --> 00:24:18,357
I’m here to apply
as Reyna Elena!

481
00:24:18,358 --> 00:24:20,827
Ooh! Thank you, girl.

482
00:24:20,835 --> 00:24:22,237
Okay, you can go now.

483
00:24:22,241 --> 00:24:26,335
Wait—are you Andres’ sister?

484
00:24:26,344 --> 00:24:29,366
Wow, you’re fabulous!

485
00:24:29,375 --> 00:24:34,492
Honestly, you’re my top pick so far.

486
00:24:34,499 --> 00:24:38,491
Unless someone still
shows up last minute.

487
00:24:38,499 --> 00:24:40,757
Just a few more minutes
before we close the auditions!

488
00:24:40,765 --> 00:24:43,577
Oh ma’am, no one else is coming!

489
00:24:43,585 --> 00:24:45,418
I’m sure of it—promise!

490
00:24:45,419 --> 00:24:47,195
Why?

491
00:24:47,208 --> 00:24:49,231
Let’s just start the audition!

492
00:24:49,239 --> 00:24:50,731
You’ll see my poses right away.

493
00:24:50,739 --> 00:24:51,739
Huh?

494
00:24:53,559 --> 00:24:56,486
Hannah’s been trying
on gowns forever!

495
00:24:56,494 --> 00:25:00,650
Still can’t decide! So picky!

496
00:25:00,658 --> 00:25:02,767
Like you’re the one modeling it!

497
00:25:02,776 --> 00:25:05,558
So picky!

498
00:25:05,565 --> 00:25:06,565
Perfect!

499
00:25:06,572 --> 00:25:09,486
Let her be picky,
that way she takes longer

500
00:25:09,494 --> 00:25:11,673
and misses the audition!

501
00:25:11,690 --> 00:25:14,352
Wow, Je.
You're dragging us into this now.

502
00:25:14,362 --> 00:25:16,582
If Hannah finds out,
you’re on your own!

503
00:25:16,586 --> 00:25:17,586
No!

504
00:25:17,594 --> 00:25:18,719
Finds out what?!

505
00:25:18,727 --> 00:25:20,704
What? Uh—what?!

506
00:25:22,621 --> 00:25:24,578
Uh… wow!

507
00:25:24,586 --> 00:25:25,924
Finds out what?

508
00:25:29,505 --> 00:25:31,072
You look amazing!

509
00:25:31,077 --> 00:25:32,350
Seriously, that’s stunning!

510
00:25:32,358 --> 00:25:34,376
It suits you so well.

511
00:25:34,381 --> 00:25:35,456
Hold on!

512
00:25:36,438 --> 00:25:38,061
What is it I’m supposed to find out?

513
00:25:38,072 --> 00:25:39,564
That you look like a giant period.

514
00:25:42,908 --> 00:25:44,285
Like what?!

515
00:25:44,286 --> 00:25:47,924
Like—never mind.

516
00:25:47,933 --> 00:25:50,573
Okay. But promise me
you won’t get mad?

517
00:25:50,581 --> 00:25:51,817
Promise?

518
00:25:52,417 --> 00:25:54,482
- No!
- Don’t get mad, okay?

519
00:25:54,487 --> 00:25:59,021
We were just trying to distract you,
so you’d take longer picking,

520
00:25:59,029 --> 00:26:00,521
and miss the audition.

521
00:26:00,529 --> 00:26:06,287
What?! Oh no, I’m late!

522
00:26:07,342 --> 00:26:08,343
Why?!

523
00:26:08,350 --> 00:26:10,278
I thought you said
you wouldn’t get mad?!

524
00:26:10,280 --> 00:26:11,670
You promised!

525
00:26:11,670 --> 00:26:15,207
I promised, but I didn’t say
I wouldn’t hurt you!

526
00:26:15,209 --> 00:26:16,508
Ouch!

527
00:26:16,514 --> 00:26:19,387
No one else is coming! Yay!

528
00:26:19,393 --> 00:26:21,089
That’s it! You got it!

529
00:26:21,096 --> 00:26:22,147
Come on, give me a smile—

530
00:26:22,151 --> 00:26:26,385
Wait! Wait, wait please!
Ma’am, wait! Please!

531
00:26:28,343 --> 00:26:29,755
Ma’am, can I still join?

532
00:26:29,757 --> 00:26:31,323
Please, can I still audition?

533
00:26:31,328 --> 00:26:33,826
Oh no, sweetie, I’m sorry—
the audition’s over.

534
00:26:33,843 --> 00:26:36,928
She’s already our
Reyna Elena—Tash!

535
00:26:38,133 --> 00:26:39,133
You?!

536
00:26:39,799 --> 00:26:42,544
You’re the reason
I got confused!

537
00:26:42,549 --> 00:26:44,097
You messed with me!

538
00:26:44,112 --> 00:26:48,174
You! You! You!

539
00:26:49,682 --> 00:26:50,901
Wait, I can explain.

540
00:26:52,633 --> 00:26:54,626
No! You don’t need
to explain anything!

541
00:26:55,712 --> 00:26:57,583
I really thought that this place

542
00:26:59,102 --> 00:27:02,421
Barangay Singko—was kind,

543
00:27:03,032 --> 00:27:05,758
helpful, full of love!

544
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:13,605
You didn’t just trick me out
of being Reyna Elena.

545
00:27:13,613 --> 00:27:18,137
You didn’t just hurt that…

546
00:27:18,144 --> 00:27:19,823
you also hurt…

547
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,950
you hurt…

548
00:27:23,963 --> 00:27:28,480
you hurt my feelings.

549
00:27:44,926 --> 00:27:49,787
Hannah, this was all my plan.
I’m so sorry.

550
00:27:49,801 --> 00:27:50,964
I really messed up.

551
00:27:53,197 --> 00:27:54,197
It’s fine.

552
00:27:55,402 --> 00:27:56,402
I’m over it.

553
00:27:56,895 --> 00:28:00,081
Besides, I knew I wasn’t going
to be Reyna Elena anyway.

554
00:28:00,087 --> 00:28:01,513
You’re not over it.

555
00:28:01,530 --> 00:28:04,477
To prove I’m really sorry,

556
00:28:04,478 --> 00:28:06,552
I talked to Madam Maita.

557
00:28:06,563 --> 00:28:09,696
You’re the Reyna Elena now.

558
00:28:10,419 --> 00:28:11,419
What?

559
00:28:12,515 --> 00:28:13,871
Why would you do that?

560
00:28:14,588 --> 00:28:20,010
They’re looking for someone
pure, sincere, untainted…

561
00:28:20,013 --> 00:28:23,185
And what I did to you
was the opposite.

562
00:28:23,192 --> 00:28:24,436
You deserve it more.

563
00:28:25,520 --> 00:28:26,764
Wow, Tash…

564
00:28:26,774 --> 00:28:29,023
I didn’t mean to take it
because of that—

565
00:28:29,031 --> 00:28:31,109
okay fine, thank you!

566
00:28:31,117 --> 00:28:35,417
And there’s someone else
who wants to apologize to you.

567
00:28:35,421 --> 00:28:37,280
I’ll give you two a moment.

568
00:28:47,478 --> 00:28:50,823
Hannah, I’m sorry.

569
00:28:53,903 --> 00:28:54,992
Don’t touch me!

570
00:28:55,713 --> 00:28:57,069
I’m not even touching you.

571
00:28:57,906 --> 00:29:00,172
You’re not? I thought you were.

572
00:29:02,247 --> 00:29:03,247
I’m really sorry.

573
00:29:06,184 --> 00:29:10,950
You know, I actually liked you.
Turns out you’re fake.

574
00:29:11,990 --> 00:29:12,990
Hey!

575
00:29:13,755 --> 00:29:15,321
Not all of it was fake!

576
00:29:15,888 --> 00:29:20,325
I really did want to help you!

577
00:29:21,050 --> 00:29:22,527
And it’s true—

578
00:29:23,592 --> 00:29:25,430
you looked amazing
in everything you wore.

579
00:29:33,781 --> 00:29:36,208
Fine. I forgive you.

580
00:29:37,119 --> 00:29:38,772
Whoa, really?!

581
00:29:38,774 --> 00:29:39,867
Mmm.

582
00:29:39,875 --> 00:29:41,258
Thank you! That’s awesome!

583
00:29:41,266 --> 00:29:44,282
So, now that I’m forgiven…

584
00:29:44,289 --> 00:29:45,450
- Hannah?
- Mmm?

585
00:29:46,745 --> 00:29:48,496
Since you’re Reyna Elena now…

586
00:29:48,503 --> 00:29:51,389
maybe you need an escort?

587
00:29:54,450 --> 00:29:56,094
Alright, then. Audition for it.

588
00:29:56,797 --> 00:29:58,301
- Okay!
- Give it your best.

589
00:29:58,302 --> 00:29:59,599
Okay.

590
00:29:59,606 --> 00:30:02,403
Hi! I’m Je,

591
00:30:02,411 --> 00:30:05,003
and I’m the perfect escort!

592
00:30:05,010 --> 00:30:06,010
Why?

593
00:30:06,018 --> 00:30:08,033
Because I can sing!

594
00:30:08,041 --> 00:30:12,310
I love you so much!

595
00:30:13,073 --> 00:30:14,680
Go on, keep going!

596
00:30:16,001 --> 00:30:17,030
I can dance too!

597
00:30:20,383 --> 00:30:21,383
I don’t like that one!

598
00:30:22,208 --> 00:30:23,688
That! Eyy!

599
00:30:24,356 --> 00:30:28,794
Other side!
Ey, ey, ey, eeeey, eeeey!

600
00:30:28,798 --> 00:30:30,172
Now drop it!

601
00:30:30,173 --> 00:30:31,173
- Huh?
- Drop it!

602
00:30:31,181 --> 00:30:32,181
Slap it!

603
00:30:32,189 --> 00:30:36,895
Slap it! Drop it!

604
00:30:36,901 --> 00:30:38,206
That’s what I’m talkin’ about!

605
00:30:38,214 --> 00:30:42,042
One more! Double, double, double,
double, double, double, double, double!

606
00:30:44,179 --> 00:30:47,328
Atasha, I heard what
you did to Hannah.

607
00:30:49,413 --> 00:30:53,092
Yes, I made a mistake.

608
00:30:53,101 --> 00:30:55,797
You really did, Atasha.

609
00:30:55,821 --> 00:30:58,056
But you made up for it
in the end.

610
00:30:58,073 --> 00:31:02,628
That’s what matters most.

611
00:31:02,633 --> 00:31:07,846
Tash, even if you
weren’t part of that…

612
00:31:07,848 --> 00:31:10,067
or even if you didn’t
become Reyna Elena,

613
00:31:11,490 --> 00:31:12,971
remember this—

614
00:31:12,982 --> 00:31:18,201
you’ll always be the
queen of our hearts.

615
00:31:19,388 --> 00:31:20,388
Here!

616
00:31:30,555 --> 00:31:32,825
- Wow!
- Surprise!

617
00:31:32,838 --> 00:31:34,025
Surprise!

618
00:31:34,900 --> 00:31:36,104
Thank you!

619
00:31:36,111 --> 00:31:37,302
It’s so pretty!

620
00:31:37,306 --> 00:31:40,383
But I have nowhere
to wear this to.

621
00:31:40,384 --> 00:31:42,776
Don’t worry, Atasha, my love!

622
00:31:42,785 --> 00:31:46,274
Guess what—I talked to Maita.

623
00:31:46,277 --> 00:31:51,081
You can still join the parade—
not as Reyna Elena,

624
00:31:51,081 --> 00:31:53,918
but as one of the queens!

625
00:31:53,934 --> 00:31:55,881
- Really?!
- See?

626
00:31:58,559 --> 00:32:00,938
Wow! Thank you, guys!

627
00:32:00,942 --> 00:32:02,574
Love the grind, love the game!

628
00:33:08,687 --> 00:33:09,855
That’s my niece!

629
00:33:36,371 --> 00:33:37,929
- Andres…
- Not your turn yet.

630
00:33:37,930 --> 00:33:39,169
We’re not done here.

631
00:33:47,064 --> 00:33:52,782
Let us just share… how…
we… paid off our huge debt!

632
00:33:52,791 --> 00:33:53,908
I messed it up, sorry!

633
00:33:56,017 --> 00:33:58,965
You know, so she wouldn’t
break the idea?

634
00:33:58,973 --> 00:34:01,746
So she can’t find
any loopholes on it?

635
00:34:01,746 --> 00:34:03,418
Got it from my dad!

636
00:34:03,443 --> 00:34:09,495
He w-w-won!

637
00:34:09,506 --> 00:34:10,973
Sorry, direk! Sorry, direk!

638
00:34:10,986 --> 00:34:12,513
Direk, sorry, sorry!
It’s his fault!

639
00:34:12,538 --> 00:34:15,079
He told me—
“Don’t forget to say raffle, okay? Raffle!”

640
00:34:15,092 --> 00:34:16,288
I’ve said it so many times!

641
00:34:16,321 --> 00:34:19,236
You have to say it!
If you don’t, he’ll forget!

642
00:34:19,250 --> 00:34:21,047
- Say “raffle!”
- Raffle, okay?!

643
00:34:33,164 --> 00:34:36,361
- Dad…
- Stop it, please.

644
00:34:36,362 --> 00:34:39,508
Stop it. Stop it.

645
00:34:41,214 --> 00:34:43,660
Stop it!

646
00:34:43,675 --> 00:34:45,393
It’s okay, it’s okay!

647
00:34:45,406 --> 00:34:47,251
Here we go, here we go!
Ready, ready! Let’s go!

648
00:34:47,252 --> 00:34:48,841
They said we’re rolling!

649
00:34:48,854 --> 00:34:52,233
5, 4, 3, 2…action!

650
00:34:52,257 --> 00:34:54,023
Grandma…

651
00:34:58,789 --> 00:35:02,501
- Game. Oh, game!
- 5, 4, 3, 2…action!

652
00:35:02,513 --> 00:35:04,895
Maybe she’s gonna use it for dr—

653
00:35:09,347 --> 00:35:10,832
Sorry, sorry!

654
00:35:10,846 --> 00:35:11,939
That's it?!

655
00:35:11,953 --> 00:35:14,035
- We’re just getting started!
- Just getting started!

656
00:35:14,049 --> 00:35:16,030
- Alright, okay. Thank you!
- Thanks!

657
00:35:16,041 --> 00:35:17,275
Thank you so much!

658
00:35:17,301 --> 00:35:19,551
We love you!
Thank you, thank you so much!

659
00:35:19,570 --> 00:35:21,679
We love you from Da Pers Family!

660
00:35:21,693 --> 00:35:24,388
In problems and joy,

661
00:35:24,401 --> 00:35:28,193
Pers comes first—Pers is the star!
